  "description": "Ma Do-Jun is a virgin ghost who wants to transcend into nirvana and part ways with the mortal world forever. The only problem, however, is that the regret of not having lost his virginity before his death is too strong! After spending decades stuck on earth with nowhere to be, he hears a rumor regarding a girl. This girl had sent countless virgin ghosts to nirvana by taking their virginities. Ma Do-Jun decides to pay the girl a visit only to find out she's not such an easy target nor will she cooperate with his mission! Instead, she whips Do-Jun into shape and shows him a world he's never seen before!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n *Note: Part of Bomtoon’s and Lezhin’s Saekgwi Danpyeonseon (색귀 단편선) Collection or Dirty Demon Collection in English.*",
